WEBVTT

00:04:28.472 --> 00:04:31.350
I have another uncomfortable idea for you.

00:04:31.892 --> 00:04:34.103
Share everything.

00:04:35.730 --> 00:04:41.027
We've learned to share a lot of things
like rides, scooters, even our homes.

00:04:41.068 --> 00:04:42.903
But when it comes to work,

00:04:42.903 --> 00:04:45.573
we so often end up sitting
on information and resources

00:04:45.614 --> 00:04:46.824
for ourselves.

00:04:47.783 --> 00:04:49.785
And have you ever thought to yourself:

00:04:49.785 --> 00:04:51.912
“I can’t ask that, it’s too stupid?”

00:04:53.873 --> 00:04:55.041
Yeah?

00:04:55.082 --> 00:04:57.209
Or maybe you've tried
withholding information

00:04:57.209 --> 00:04:59.170
thinking it would give you an advantage?

00:04:59.170 --> 00:05:00.463
(Laughter)